---
# High-value static-analysis gate (see audit REPORT.md, 2026-09).
# Deliberately excludes style-only groups (readability-*, magic numbers,
# identifier length), misc-const-correctness, and
# bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: too noisy to gate on today (the latter
# flags stable public APIs with same-typed adjacent parameters).
# cert-err33-c stays off: its hits are fprintf(stderr)/snprintf return values;
# data-integrity fwrite paths are already checked by construction.
Checks: '-*,bugprone-*,-bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,cert-err34-c,cert-err60-cpp,cert-msc32-c,cert-msc51-cpp,cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-member-init,cppcoreguidelines-init-variables,cppcoreguidelines-no-malloc,cppcoreguidelines-owning-memory'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'thyme/(src|include)'
...
